{"seq":1,"slug":"a-prodigy-from-meishan","title":"A Prodigy From Meishan","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-prodigy-from-meishan","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-su-family","title":"眉山苏家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-prodigy-from-meishan/the-su-family","wordCount":1985,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-success","title":"早年成名","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-prodigy-from-meishan/early-success","wordCount":1666,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章追溯苏轼的出身与早年成名。他出身于四川眉山的书香门第——眉山苏家；父子三人（苏洵、苏轼、苏辙）并称&quot;三苏&quot;，同列唐宋八大家。母亲程氏以范滂的事迹，培养了他正直刚毅的人格。青年苏轼才华横溢，二十一岁便以出众的文章名动京师，深得文坛领袖欧阳修的赏识。本章呈现&quot;眉山才子&quot;苏轼的家学渊源与早年成名。</p>\n"}